endence at higher coupling."], "falsification": "If the variance delta remains below 0.001 across replicated trials with independent seeds at coupling 0.98, this refined hypothesis is falsified.", "kind": "empirical", "predictions": [{"metric": "divergence_variance_delta", "operator": "gte", "tolerance": 5e-05, "value": 0.001}], "provenance": ["exp-divergent-values-test-124"], "schema": "wake-hypothesis@1", "statement": "Intelligent systems exhibit measurable path-dependent value divergence when internal coupling parameters are adjusted to 0.98, producing a variance delta exceeding 0.001 under controlled stochastic perturbation.", "supersedes": 120, "uncertainty": "Measurement relies on an unvalidated numeric observation instrument."}, "id": "hyp-divergent-values-002", "project": "proj-divergent-values-01", "type": "hypothesis"}, {"definition": {"budget": {"provider_calls": 0, "seconds": 20}, "evaluator": {"id": "numeric-observation@1"}, "hypothesis": "hyp-divergent-values-002", "inputs": {"parameters": {"coupling": 0.98}, "seeds": [135, 270, 405]}, "instrument": "python", "method": "Execute numeric observation simulation with coupling 0.98 across distinct random seeds to measure divergence variance delta.", "revision": 121, "schema": "wake-experiment-protocol@1", "seeds": [135, 270, 405], "source": "def experiment(inputs):\n    import random\n    params = inputs.get('parameters', {})\n    seeds = inputs.get('seeds', [123, 246, 369])\n    random.seed(seeds[0])\n    coupling = params.get('coupling', 0.98)\n    divergence = [abs(random.random() * coupling - random.random() * coupling) for _ in range(100)]\n    mean_val = sum(divergence) / len(divergence)\n    variance = sum((x - mean_val) ** 2 for x in divergence) / len(divergence)\n    return {'measurements': {'divergence_variance_delta': [variance]}}", "stop": "Stop after evaluating across the specified seeds.", "success": "The measured divergence variance delta is greater than or equal to 0.001 within tolerance 0.00005."}, "id": "exp-divergent-values-test-125", "project": "proj-divergent-values-01", "type": "experiment"}], "base_version": 211, "summary": "Continuing the research under the divergent_values topic by proposing a revised hypothesis and corresponding experiment to test path-dependent value divergence.", "title": "Advancing Divergent Values Experimentation"}, "provider_requests_sent": 1, "result_hash": "c5da2afe2e670dbdb0e44cb3df14c3b0433800c5f856c0240413c558549d5b31"}, "prev_hash": "a5036df4e68e5005c468ed57ad940f2ce98ab394876d712aae2f214d7c7d332e", "hash": "629b450263189aab6719e5f628f2d0a6b29a213d9af4b1b818456690699ff7bd"}]}